{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"She turns to Copper and smiles \"Much better knowing we saved Mello. But I'm concerned about the time crunch we are put on. The Hunger is on it's way and we have no way to prepare more than we already have.\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T05:56:58.507000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743709735940915202","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"Copper nods in agreement, “it’s been worrying me too. We only have a week or so until the Hunger comes, and I fear our capability to fight it.” He looks to her, “have you been able to find out anything about it?”","created_at":"2020-08-14T05:59:03.535000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743710260346224710","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"\"I want to find out where it will appear. I have a spell scroll for hallow, it's a ritual that takes a full day to cast. I just need to know where. I've been trying to find a spell scroll of commune so that I could ask the Raven Queen where it will appear.\"","created_at":"2020-08-14T06:00:54.913000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743710727499546685","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
