{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"(Oooh that’s right)\nCopper perks up, “oh wait. There has been much loot from quests that no one has claimed. It’s possible I have one stored away.”\nHe drops his bag on the ground and begins pulling stuff out. Rings, jewels, rocks, a pot all flop out. He pulls out 3 scrolls, “protection, no. Demon contract, no. Dark vision, no. Ah ha!” He holds the scroll up to you, “is this what you are looking for?”","created_at":"2020-08-14T06:09:38.747000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743712924618588230","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
